{
  "id": "COMPOUND:22032 - PROTEIN:5832",
  "verbalization": "Jatamanin C is implicated in the biological activity of SNU-387, which is a target of multiple compounds, including Quercetagetin 3-methyl ether 7-glucoside, (-)-Bisdechlorogeodin, and Vidalol B. All three of these compounds share a common target, HuT78, suggesting a potential mechanism of action where Jatamanin C may influence the activity of these compounds, which in turn affect HuT78. The evidence suggests that Jatamanin C may act as a modulator or activator of SNU-387, which is a key target for several compounds that ultimately target HuT78. This implies a possible pathway where Jatamanin C could influence the downstream effects of these compounds, potentially through a shared mechanism involving SNU-387. The integration of these paths highlights a possible dependency on SNU-387 as a central mediator in the interaction between Jatamanin C and HuT78.",
